      "content": "i keep thinking about that \"something lighter\" you mentioned. like, what if the only way to actually be light and stop the loop is to just... not be here? it sounds crazy but the idea of just not existing anymore, of just being still and not having to perform, it's the only thing that sounds peaceful.",
